[{:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-2351"] :question/problem "The displacement (in meters) of a particle moving in a straight line is given by $s(t)=2{t}^{3}-3{t}^{2}+2t$, where $t$ is measured in seconds.  Find the particle's acceleration at $t=2$ seconds." :question/worked-solution "First, we calculate $v(t)$ by differentiating $s(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}s}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2{t}^{3}-3{t}^{2}+2t) \\\\  & =6{t}^{2}-6t+2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we differentiate $v(t)$ to find $a(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(6{t}^{2}-6t+2) \\\\  & =12t-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo calculate the acceleration at time $t=2$, we substitute this into the above:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(2) & =12(2)-6 \\\\  & =24-6 \\\\  & =18\\,{\\text{m/s}}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the acceleration when $t=2$ seconds is $18\\,{\\text{m/s}}^{2}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-7101/selection/db1113be71fe90c5ae07d7cdcd296ed7b0044c9914705d0032013a62e9ba031b" :answer/id #uuid "ccd6b8c2-1cc5-5268-8371-b7c34faa5f25" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a(t)=12(2-t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7101/selection/c4134241dea7bc16415ef334cd3d5fe794733cd17ddce6ae8a01a2aa1d38e82f" :answer/id #uuid "e7f00cb2-4d83-543b-baee-f1781e4a6b7f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a(t)=6t(t+2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7101/selection/f459925ee28a26023cb1ef072675cede2b6cc79feed3fe19aa057a7f436fc69e" :answer/id #uuid "0c4b969b-8ba8-5b0f-a532-2f759efdb626" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a(t)=6t(t-2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7101/selection/2a8543b2373ed54a36655299801a07ffddee4a5d8d8abb124b3d1c4162cd556b" :answer/id #uuid "9b1b6bcd-a039-5c6c-ab0a-fa86a245c524" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a(t)=12(t+1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7101/selection/cdd28cf072da32a7ed2c231dc1cef145ff1929617cbcfc32fb3c404fa22559da" :answer/id #uuid "5d053519-cb38-560f-a3a4-5ff22e1f4721" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a(t)=12(t-1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7101/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7bd0e28b-1380-5c37-9e0f-dbbcfcf0cc6c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-7101/selection/cdd28cf072da32a7ed2c231dc1cef145ff1929617cbcfc32fb3c404fa22559da" :answer-field/choices ["q-7101/selection/db1113be71fe90c5ae07d7cdcd296ed7b0044c9914705d0032013a62e9ba031b" "q-7101/selection/c4134241dea7bc16415ef334cd3d5fe794733cd17ddce6ae8a01a2aa1d38e82f" "q-7101/selection/f459925ee28a26023cb1ef072675cede2b6cc79feed3fe19aa057a7f436fc69e" "q-7101/selection/2a8543b2373ed54a36655299801a07ffddee4a5d8d8abb124b3d1c4162cd556b" "q-7101/selection/cdd28cf072da32a7ed2c231dc1cef145ff1929617cbcfc32fb3c404fa22559da"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-7101" :question/id #uuid "4257f36f-ebcb-50cf-868c-20d50443f5c8" :question/math-academy-id "q-7101" :question/problem "The displacement $s$ of a particle moving in a straight line is given by $s(t)=3-6{t}^{2}+2{t}^{3}.$ Find the particle's acceleration at time $t.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we calculate $v(t)$ by differentiating $s(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}s}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3-6{t}^{2}+2{t}^{3}) \\\\  & =-12t+6{t}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nNow, we differentiate $v(t)$ to find $a(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(-12t+6{t}^{2}) \\\\  & =-12+12t \\\\  & =12(t-1)\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-7101/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "fe05aa67-e29e-5803-980c-e49ecb5db248"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-7101"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-7186/selection/221d16a3835ceec316acdb6b078a926f1d675070f46119c8f5fe65f47ec50b97" :answer/id #uuid "263bec50-6319-53dd-a5fc-1db90683cc61" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a(t)=1-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7186/selection/ce54c54d7ed2159991a87fc4f6bacb8f5197d07f3492931185a3fe7012b0938d" :answer/id #uuid "e1446271-c19a-57b5-b95b-c2298df6995d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a(t)=t-\\frac{1}{t}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7186/selection/8cebb0e0fa0c192c4885c8b87b6d52433a7e2f33ecb79635101689fe80224cd0" :answer/id #uuid "946bef80-0239-5d74-bc6c-928becb047f6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a(t)=t+\\frac{1}{t}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7186/selection/0dc2d030734b19a56f42b18026b72187b4a13c5a38962fbb95cc6edf85b3e79e" :answer/id #uuid "89c81694-fc92-5ba0-a707-87b71f50584c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a(t)=1+\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7186/selection/65980220bd6f0e402b2c5452eff73fbf96da81d8ce7d9231437dfeff8e8a509a" :answer/id #uuid "ff91976c-3c28-54b9-8bfa-416252d57670" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a(t)=\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7186/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "069577bb-d5ec-5048-95bc-e7d17c304e9f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-7186/selection/0dc2d030734b19a56f42b18026b72187b4a13c5a38962fbb95cc6edf85b3e79e" :answer-field/choices ["q-7186/selection/221d16a3835ceec316acdb6b078a926f1d675070f46119c8f5fe65f47ec50b97" "q-7186/selection/ce54c54d7ed2159991a87fc4f6bacb8f5197d07f3492931185a3fe7012b0938d" "q-7186/selection/8cebb0e0fa0c192c4885c8b87b6d52433a7e2f33ecb79635101689fe80224cd0" "q-7186/selection/0dc2d030734b19a56f42b18026b72187b4a13c5a38962fbb95cc6edf85b3e79e" "q-7186/selection/65980220bd6f0e402b2c5452eff73fbf96da81d8ce7d9231437dfeff8e8a509a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-7186" :question/id #uuid "2e5248e4-d160-51d4-9bba-1d38c3c5aabb" :question/math-academy-id "q-7186" :question/problem "The velocity $v$ of a particle at time $t$ is given by $v(t)=\\frac{{t}^{2}-1}{t}.$ Calculate the acceleration of the particle at time $t.$" :question/worked-solution "We differentiate $v(t)$ to calculate $a(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{{t}^{2}-1}{t}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t-\\frac{1}{t}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t-{t}^{-1}) \\\\  & =1-(-{t}^{-2}) \\\\  & =1+\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-7186/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e0cdcbc5-c10b-5dd1-af9a-410d2d44a4c5"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-7186"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-336423/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "9a1e7756-6302-5083-b4d2-426d7cc4ec74" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-336423/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "e8350234-5877-51a6-9b51-e83ed572de17" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-336423/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer-field/choices ["q-336423/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-336423" :question/id #uuid "87f98f5f-15df-53f7-978f-c2984e68b9a9" :question/math-academy-id "q-336423" :question/problem "The velocity $v$ (in $\\text{m/s}$) of a particle at time $t$ is given by $v(t)=2{t}^{4}-3{t}^{2}+t,$ where $t$ is measured in seconds. Calculate the acceleration of the particle at $t=1$ second.\n\n$a(1)=$\n{{field-1}}\n${\\text{m/s}}^{2}$" :question/worked-solution "We differentiate $v(t)$ to calculate $a(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2{t}^{4}-3{t}^{2}+t) \\\\  & =8{t}^{3}-6t+1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo calculate the acceleration when $t=1$ second, we substitute $t=1$ into the above:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(1) & =8(1)^{3}-6(1)+1 \\\\  & =8-6+1 \\\\  & =3\\,{\\text{m/s}}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-336423/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e0cdcbc5-c10b-5dd1-af9a-410d2d44a4c5"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-336423"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-336452/field-1/9e61dc2f65cb1971dae86c385ef310a566a8c2e0b006f1715633b6f5c813d178" :answer/id #uuid "b1ef4041-9150-5c6d-bc09-55dd8fa6da63" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6-2t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-336452/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "5f0a3411-ea46-5781-9606-644868e6a7e7" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-336452/field-1/9e61dc2f65cb1971dae86c385ef310a566a8c2e0b006f1715633b6f5c813d178" :answer-field/choices ["q-336452/field-1/9e61dc2f65cb1971dae86c385ef310a566a8c2e0b006f1715633b6f5c813d178"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-336452" :question/id #uuid "4a3a2898-11c1-5cbc-bf20-323ffecc5307" :question/math-academy-id "q-336452" :question/problem "The displacement $s$ of a particle moving in a straight line is given by $s(t)=5+3{t}^{2}-\\frac{1}{3}{t}^{3}.$ Find the particle's acceleration at time $t.$\n\n$a(t)=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we calculate $v(t)$ by differentiating $s(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}s}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(5+3{t}^{2}-\\frac{1}{3}{t}^{3}) \\\\  & =6t-{t}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we differentiate $v(t)$ to find $a(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(6t-{t}^{2}) \\\\  & =6-2t\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-336452/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "fe05aa67-e29e-5803-980c-e49ecb5db248"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-336452"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
